@startuml
title Compaction 服务闭环

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "表体检\n文件大小、数量、Delete Debt、热分区" as inspect #E0F2FE
rectangle "候选选择\n收益 / IO 成本 / 并发冲突风险" as select #FEF3C7
rectangle "File Group 切分\n分区内按数据量分组" as group
rectangle "Rewrite\nbin-pack 或 sort" as rewrite #FEE2E2
rectangle "Snapshot Commit\n记录重写输入与输出" as commit #DCFCE7
rectangle "验收\n文件分布、查询计划、失败组" as verify #DCFCE7
rectangle "节流与下轮计划\n避免追赶实时写入" as next #E0F2FE

inspect --> select
select --> group
group --> rewrite
rewrite --> commit
commit --> verify
verify --> next

note bottom of next
  下一轮重新体检，不沿用旧候选；
  债务变化与查询热度都可能改变优先级
end note

note right of select
  不是“到点全表重写”，
  而是只处理收益明确的 file groups
end note

note right of commit
  partial progress 会产生多次提交；
  必须逐组记录成功与失败
end note
@enduml
